@startuml OpenSimComponent
!include ../../includes/thesis_theme.puml
left to right direction

abstract class CoSimComponent {
    + initialize(t0)
    + do_step(t, dt)
    + evaluate_outputs(inputs, t)
    --
    # _initialize_component(t0)
    # _do_step_internal(t, dt)
    # _update_output_states(t)
}

abstract class OpenSimComponent {
    + name: str
    + parameters: dict
    - _path: str
    # model: osim.Model
    # state: osim.State
    # manager: osim.Manager
    --
    + integrator_method
    + integrator_accuracy
    + internal_dt
    --
    # _finalize_model(t0)
    + realize()
    + reset()
    --
    + get_coordinate_value(name)
    + get_coordinate_speed(name)
    + get_coordinate_acceleration(name)
    + set_coordinate_value(name, v)
    + set_coordinate_speed(name, v)
}

class "Model" as OsimModel <<opensim>> {
    + initSystem() : State
    + getCoordinateSet()
    + realizePosition/Velocity/
        Dynamics/Acceleration(state)
}

class "Manager" as OsimManager <<opensim>> {
    + setIntegratorMethod(method)
    + setIntegratorAccuracy(acc)
    + initialize(state)
    + integrate(t)
}

class "State" as OsimState <<opensim>> {
    + setTime(t)
    + getTime()
}

CoSimComponent <|-- OpenSimComponent
OpenSimComponent --> OsimModel   : owns\n(musculoskeletal model)
OpenSimComponent --> OsimManager : owns\n(Simbody integrator)
OpenSimComponent --> OsimState   : owns\n(realization cache)

note top of OpenSimComponent
  **Base wrapper** for OpenSim models.
  Concrete subclasses assemble the model
  and declare ports in their own
  _initialize_component.
end note

note bottom of OsimModel
  Multibody system of bodies,
  joints, forces, and muscle
  actuators (Simbody backend).
end note

note bottom of OsimManager
  Drives Simbody's numerical
  integrator between communication
  points.
end note

@enduml